  "title": "Mom&#39;s Spiced Pear Bread",
  "description": "This easy pear bread with raisins is spiced with all your favorite fall spices and is sure to be a hit with your family.",
  "authors": [
    "Char and Gary"
  ],
  "date_published": "2015-10-27T14:10:29-04:00",
